{"seq":2,"slug":"losses","title":"损失","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/metric-learning-embeddings/losses","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"contrastive-loss","title":"对比损失：同类相吸，异类相斥","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/metric-learning-embeddings/losses/contrastive-loss","wordCount":1409,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"triplet-loss","title":"三元组与难例挖掘：相对次序才是检索的语言","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/metric-learning-embeddings/losses/triplet-loss","wordCount":1423,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"proxy-based","title":"基于代理的损失：让类代理终结采样噩梦","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/metric-learning-embeddings/losses/proxy-based","wordCount":1511,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"损失\">损失</h1><p>如果说嵌入网络是把样本压成向量的机器，那么损失函数就是告诉这台机器&quot;什么该靠近、什么该推远&quot;的指令集。度量学习的全部智慧几乎都浓缩在损失的设计里，本章按三代思路展开。</p>\n<p>第一篇《对比损失》从最朴素的成对约束讲起：同类拉近、异类推远且带一个间隔（margin）。这套 Siamese/对比范式简单直观，也是自监督对比学习（InfoNCE、NT-Xent）的直系祖先——把&quot;正样本&quot;换成同一图像的两个增广视图，就从有监督滑向了自监督。</p>\n<p>第二篇《三元组与难例挖掘》把约束从&quot;绝对距离&quot;升级为&quot;相对次序&quot;：锚点离正样本要比离负样本近至少一个间隔。三元组损失更贴合检索的本质，但它的成败几乎完全系于采样——绝大多数三元组是&quot;简单&quot;的、梯度为零的，于是难例挖掘（hard/semi-hard mining、batch-hard）成为绕不开的主题。</p>\n<p>第三篇《基于代理的损失》回应采样之痛：给每个类别设一个可学习的代理向量，样本只跟代理比，把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^3)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的组合爆炸压回近似 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。从 ProxyNCA、Proxy-Anchor，到把 softmax 分类头改造成角度间隔的 ArcFace/CosFace，再到 2025 年调和样本中心与代理中心的 Proxy-AN，这条线代表了当前的主流实践。</p>\n<p>三篇的关系是&quot;约束从成对→相对→代理逐步松绑采样负担&quot;。读时请随手对照 <a href=\"../foundations/metric-learning-taxonomy\">谱系图</a>确认方法归位；损失塑造出的空间长什么样、为何会崩，交给 <a href=\"../geometry/\">几何章</a>。前置：已理解 <a href=\"../foundations/distance-similarity\">距离与相似性</a>里的余弦与欧氏定义。</p>\n"}